{"3756900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BreadKnight Adventures", "steam_appid": 3756900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features Include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Delve into the world as the <strong>BreadKnight</strong>! Complete quests and explore as you wish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Indulge yourself in the story as you progress towards the final battle!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/de261a00f15461906cf8cd19dc916008.apng?t=1753972511\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/de261a00f15461906cf8cd19dc916008.poster.avif?t=1753972511\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Defeat the Evil <u>Antibread!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The <u>Antibread</u> has kidnapped the <strong>Butter Princess</strong>! You need to save her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/6f0900dd1509faacac33b43248ef9ab7.apng?t=1753972511\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/6f0900dd1509faacac33b43248ef9ab7.poster.avif?t=1753972511\" class=\"bb_img\" width=202 height=224 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fight in <strong>Turn-based combat</strong> to defeat enemies standing in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Expand your party with enigmatic personalities! They will help you defeat the evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/ae07d4c1d528deb5cb92b338911ca7c4.apng?t=1753972511\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/ae07d4c1d528deb5cb92b338911ca7c4.poster.avif?t=1753972511\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=150 /></picture></span>                                      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find the Legendary Unicorn and ride them! It's not so easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- They say that only hard work and a true heart can reach a unicorn's will.                                                                                                                <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/51ada8fc31126159aafa290b70e04284.poster.avif?t=1753972511\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/51ada8fc31126159aafa290b70e04284.webm?t=1753972511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Awesome <strong>music,</strong> Awesome <strong>vibes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hilarious characters living their most oblivious lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/f5e11b9de026aab151ca29023ce186ed.poster.avif?t=1753972511\" width=120 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/f5e11b9de026aab151ca29023ce186ed.webm?t=1753972511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <u>Autosave</u>, and <u>manual save</u> whenever you need.<br>- Open world Exploration, and some puzzles.<br>- Achievements.<br>- All dialogues voiced and subtitled, or skippable if you prefer.<br>- Turn-Based combat and strategy!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features Include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Delve into the world as the <strong>BreadKnight</strong>! Complete quests and explore as you wish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Indulge yourself in the story as you progress towards the final battle!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/de261a00f15461906cf8cd19dc916008.apng?t=1753972511\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/de261a00f15461906cf8cd19dc916008.poster.avif?t=1753972511\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Defeat the Evil <u>Antibread!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The <u>Antibread</u> has kidnapped the <strong>Butter Princess</strong>! You need to save her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/6f0900dd1509faacac33b43248ef9ab7.apng?t=1753972511\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/6f0900dd1509faacac33b43248ef9ab7.poster.avif?t=1753972511\" class=\"bb_img\" width=202 height=224 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fight in <strong>Turn-based combat</strong> to defeat enemies standing in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Expand your party with enigmatic personalities! They will help you defeat the evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/ae07d4c1d528deb5cb92b338911ca7c4.apng?t=1753972511\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/ae07d4c1d528deb5cb92b338911ca7c4.poster.avif?t=1753972511\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=150 /></picture></span>                                      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find the Legendary Unicorn and ride them! It's not so easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- They say that only hard work and a true heart can reach a unicorn's will.                                                                                                                <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/51ada8fc31126159aafa290b70e04284.poster.avif?t=1753972511\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/51ada8fc31126159aafa290b70e04284.webm?t=1753972511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Awesome <strong>music,</strong> Awesome <strong>vibes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hilarious characters living their most oblivious lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/f5e11b9de026aab151ca29023ce186ed.poster.avif?t=1753972511\" width=120 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/extras/f5e11b9de026aab151ca29023ce186ed.webm?t=1753972511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <u>Autosave</u>, and <u>manual save</u> whenever you need.<br>- Open world Exploration, and some puzzles.<br>- Achievements.<br>- All dialogues voiced and subtitled, or skippable if you prefer.<br>- Turn-Based combat and strategy!</p>", "short_description": "Embark on an Adventure with BreadKnight and his crew to face the fearsome AntiBread! Many quests to complete with hilarious dialogue, and mysterious characters. Turn based combat, defeat your enemies by slapping them with baguettes or cheese! Beware: Dangerous to individuals with a lack of humour.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/98e325e2270069ba95aea0ee46d5d6dde7717b70/header.jpg?t=1753972511", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/0444367e439b4ddfb7fda2117395a856df44af9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753972511", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756900/0444367e439b4ddfb7fda2117395a856df44af9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753972511", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-540<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> intel UHD graphics 600 <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-530<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> intel UHD graphics 620 <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Evergreen Developer"], "publishers": ["Evergreen Developer"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 499, "final": 499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$4.99"}, "package